control_assertion:
We have the equations \begin{align*} \tag{1}
\frac{a+b+c}{3}=6 \Rightarrow a+b+c&=18 \\ \tag{2}
c-4&=a\\ \tag{3}
b+4&=\frac{3}{5}(a+4)
\end{align*} From Equation (3), we have $b=\frac{3}{5}(a+4)-4$.

